        "answer": {
          "short": "An upward-opening parabola with vertex at $x=0$.",
          "worked": "The straight gradient graph has nonzero slope, so $f$ is quadratic. The gradient changes from negative to zero to positive at $x=0$, so the parabola opens upwards and its vertex is a minimum at $x=0$.",
